# Klingon (tlhIngan Hol) translation for SeedSigner.
# Latin transliteration; the pIqaD script needs a font the device does not carry.
#
# Intentionally partial. Only strings with attested vocabulary from Marc Okrand's
# Klingon Dictionary are translated; everything else falls back to English, which
# includes every security warning. Klingon has no vocabulary for "Native Segwit",
# "derivation path" and the like, and inventing some on a bitcoin signing device
# would be worse than leaving it in English.
#
msgid ""
msgstr ""
